                    "text": "We're hiring diesel technicians, parts specialists and sales professionals across our dealership network in Illinois, Iowa, Wisconsin, Michigan, Indiana and Ohio. Benefits include paid training, weekly pay, health/dental/vision insurance, paid time off, 401K with employer match, company-provided gear and tuition reimbursement.",
