                  "id": "careers-p2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our Technical Training Institute runs two state-of-the-art centers, in Dubuque, IA and Indianapolis, IN, backed by over 100 years of combined industry experience. Technicians train and certify in Freightliner, Detroit and more, with paid training, lodging and travel along the way.",
